      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waverly%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s first business was a general store opened by Gimble, soon followed by a railroad station and grain warehouses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
